eol%3Dlf%0A%23%20Self-translation%20round-trips%20meta-language%27s%20own%20modules%20byte%20for%20byte%2C%20and%20the%0A%23%20self-translation%20and%20decorator%20corpora%20are%20compared%20byte%20for%20byte%3B%20Windows%20checkouts%0A%23%20must%20not%20add%20CRs.%20The%20vendored%20grammars%20keep%20their%20upstream%20bytes.%0Arust%2Fsrc%2F%2A%2A%20text%3Dauto%20eol%3Dlf%0Ajs%2Fsrc%2F%2A%2A%20text%3Dauto%20eol%3Dlf%0Ajs%2Fsrc%2Fvendor%2F%2A%2A%20-text%0Aparity%2Fself-translation%2F%2A%2A%20text%3Dauto%20eol%3Dlf%0Aparity%2Fdecorators%2F%2A%2A%20text%3Dauto%20eol%3Dlf%0A%23%20The%20mapped-selection%20fixture%20pins%20these%20authored%20source%20files%20by%20exact%20bytes%0A%23%20and%20SHA-256.%20Keep%20their%20checkout%20bytes%20fixed%20without%20normalizing%20raw%20fixtures.%0Ajs%2Ftests%2Fgrammar-selection-json-string.test.js%20text%20eol%3Dlf%0Ajs%2Ftests%2Fsupport%2Fgrammar-selection-mapping-cases.js%20text%20eol%3Dlf%0Ajs%2Fscripts%2Fgenerate-grammar-selection-mapping-fixtures.mjs%20text%20eol%3Dlf%0Arust%2Ftests%2Funit%2Fgrammar_recursive_selection.rs%20text%20eol%3Dlf%0Arust%2Ftests%2Funit%2Fgrammar_recursive_selection_mapping.rs%20text%20eol%3Dlf%0A%23%20The%20lexer-complement%20control%20matches%20its%20complete%20original%20source%20snapshot.%0Arust%2Ftests%2Ffixtures%2Fgrammar%2Fantlr%2Fset-complement.g4%20text%20eol%3Dlf%0A%23%20The%20original%20token-negation%20snapshot%20and%20queue%20patch%20authenticate%20exact%20bytes.%0Arust%2Ftests%2Ffixtures%2Fgrammar%2Fantlr%2Fcovering.g4%20text%20eol%3Dlf%0Arust%2Fvendor%2Ftree-sitter-agda-layout%2Flayout-state.patch%20text%20eol%3Dlf%0A%23%20Rust%20embeds%20a%20copy%20of%20the%20foundation%20register%20and%20compares%20it%20to%20this%20file%20byte%20for%20byte.%0Aparity%2Ffoundation-models.json%20text%20eol%3Dlf%0A%23%20The%20retained%20array%20contract%20and%20both%20authored%20source%20profiles%20are%20hashed%20before%0A%23%20execution.%20Preserve%20their%20exact%20bytes%20when%20Windows%20enables%20automat